WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.990
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.500
Stop Making People Panic About Keters!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.059
Keter class anomalies are the most difficult
to contain, and are often highly dangerous.

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:17.170
From SCP-682 to SCP-353, most Keters are not
the sort of thing you'd want to come face

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.170
to face with.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.550
So, a containment breach of a Keter class
anomaly is reason to panic!\

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.950
For the same reason it's not ok to yell "fire"
in a crowded theater,

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.670
it's also not acceptable to run down the halls
of an SCP Foundation Site while screaming

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.210
"THE KETER IS LOOSE!"

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.369
So Dr. Bright?

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:33.710
Stop doing it.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.949
Unless it's a real emergency.

